00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:37.340
Then wait for the final regulatory or exchange nod before entering.

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:43.500
Use volume above the 20-day average as confirmation. This approach has historically worked

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:50.000
best in the 30-60 days after approval, when the market prices in the combined entities growth.

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:56.340
The main risk is overpaying if the acquired assets carry hidden liabilities that surface in

00:02:56.340 --> 00:03:03.020
